          "text": "Kunini maqa abbooti worraatifi jaarole gosatifi ammalle worra gugurda, askartile ka lafa Israeli keesa huji hayyu hojatu. Ganna keesa jia ch'ufa worri suni, nami kuma diddami, afuri, namicha gudda worraa jala, jia jiaani huji suni hojata.",
