        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini nama Israeli ka ganni isaa diddama jala inhenne, wonti akanatiifi AABBO Waaqi qara kakhate waan jed'e, Anini gosa Israeli hedese, aka urji gubbaa lafa ira dabarsa. ",
          "type": "text",
