                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabuni, ilmi Seruya, henna jala qabate ammo inhobaamne lakise. Maro henna sunitifi Waaqi Israeliti dallane, tanaafi henna suni kitaaba Daudi keesati int'aafini.",
          "type": "text",
